# What the job image carries for renters' code (agent/images/pytorch/README.md). Resolved, with hashes, into
# requirements.lock by `./lock.sh`; the image installs only from the lock (`pip install --require-hashes`), so it is the same
# bytes every build. No model is in here, or ever: renters bring their own (ADR 0022).
